ADDENDA <Act No. 20167, Jan. 30, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force 6 months after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning change of name)
The Korea Road Traffic Authority established as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the Korea Road Traffic Authority under this Act. In such cases, the Authority shall obtain authorization of the Commissioner General of the Korean National Police Agency after amending its articles of association according to the amended provisions of this Act within 3 months from the date this Act enters into force.
Article 3 (Succession to property, rights, and obligations)
The Authority established under this Act shall comprehensively succeed to all the property, rights, and obligations of the Korea Road Traffic Authority established under the previous provisions.
Article 4 (Transitional measures concerning executive officers and employees)
The executive officers and employees of the Korea Road Traffic Authority established under the previous provisions as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the executive officers and employees of the Authority under this Act. In such cases, the term of office of the executive officers and employees shall be the remaining term of office under the previous provisions.
Article 5 (Transitional measures concerning penalty provisions)
The previous provisions shall apply to the imposition of penalty provisions for acts committed before this Act enters into force.
Article 6 (Transitional measures concerning scope of application of previous Addenda)
The previous Addenda provided under the amendment of the previous Road Traffic Act shall remain applicable even after this Act enters into force, to the extent that they do not conflict with this Act, unless they were invalidated before this Act enters into force.
Article 7 Omitted.
